<title>JAPAN: Foreigners neutral on Japan stocks via 'Big Four'.</title>
<headline>Foreigners neutral on Japan stocks via 'Big Four'.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors via Japan's &quot;Big Four&quot; securities houses before the start of stock trading on Monday showed a net neutral stance, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors placed 5.0 million shares of buy orders against a similar amount of sell orders.</p>
